Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Eve
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, the goats decided to settle the choice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,of captain and team name by racing to the venue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,While they were deadlocked, they encountered the reserve players of Team Wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After realizing the gap in their abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the goats learned to work together and arrived at the venue just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve finished explaining the tactics against Team Rat;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,make sure you remember them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our first match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.68,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Success is the only option; failure is not permitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be too nervous—just relax a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.28,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.64,0:01:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,During the previous game against the Team Rats,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to dribble past the defense at high speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I failed. I’m thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,if I could master that move…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe it would help the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That move, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can master that move,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.52,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it would really be a huge help to the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But whenever I speed up, the ball just won’t do what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What…what exactly am I missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After training for this long,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:01:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ve already developed a feel for dribbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What you’re missing now is an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,An opportunity?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That opportunity will come naturally when the time is right; you can’t rush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But our first game is tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need to practice more and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The opportunity will come naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need to practice more and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.64,0:02:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The opportunity will come naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I still need to practice some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We absolutely cannot lose to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to work harder,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can keep playing with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,“Opportunity”…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.48,0:03:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,what exactly does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve practiced so many times; why is it still like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s throwing the ball around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With your short arms and legs, Goat Clan has absolutely no advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think you can play basketball?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d better hurry home and do your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we absolutely cannot lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Defenders’ journey has only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.28,0:04:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It can’t end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to lead everyone to win the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I come out for running practice every night now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you made the starting lineup?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that I’ve made the choice, I’m going to give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My goal isn’t just to get on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I also want to be the star player of the basketball team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To live up to the expectations of Wolnie and Wilie,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to prove to everyone that I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you; you can definitely do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you training too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m practicing my drives, but I just can’t seem to get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you have a really great coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he teach you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.64,0:05:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach just said I was missing an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But what exactly is this opportunity?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn’t tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:06:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,An opportunity…Does it mean breaking through yourself at a critical moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve always been like this, haven’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,At a…critical moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.72,0:06:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have a game tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You absolutely can’t lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As Team Wolves’ future star player,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m looking forward to facing you on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.12,0:06:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.20,0:06:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re so cool! Could you teach me that move you just did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If I learn it, maybe I can win tomorrow’s game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I’m tired from playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m heading back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If no one will teach me, I’ll learn it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I—I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been playing basketball for so long, yet I haven’t mastered a single move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to win a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you teach me a powerful special move that guarantees a win?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no such thing as a special move in basketball that guarantees a win the moment you learn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But tomorrow is our team’s first official match.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lose, my teammates and I’s basketball team will come to an end,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and our dream will be shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What you need right now isn’t a special move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s about getting your mindset right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mindset?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter the situation, you have to enjoy the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,focus on the game, and do your best at what you can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the strongest version of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do my best at what I can control?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what’s your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Help…help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m here to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,At a time like this, why are you still carrying that ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This feeling…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re rolling again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here and take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Haste makes waste; don’t overthink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax and the opportunity will come naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened? How did you dodge it in a split second?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:11:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I’ve finally got the feel for driving at high speed without losing the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie? So you’re out here training too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still feel like I haven’t practiced enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I help everyone like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.44,0:11:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys…go back and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But we still feel it’s not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, could you give us some extra training?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in yourselves; you’ve already done a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, trust your teammates, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Basketball is a five-player sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t try to shoulder everything yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s only been one night,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you all seem like different goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mindset is so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What we need to do is enjoy the game, focus on the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and do our best at what we can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s the strongest version of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s give it our all, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.24,0:12:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where’s Paddi?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
